# Formal charge, which SDF's atom block cannot hold in the form our writer
# emits — the loss #183's mask reports and this file makes an oracle confirm.

[NH4+] ammonium
[OH-] hydroxide
c1ccccc1[N+](=O)[O-] nitrobenzene
[Mg+2] magnesium-ion
C[N+](C)(C)C tetramethylammonium
# Net neutral, two charges. A writer that drops charges silently produces a
# molecule that is not merely uncharged but chemically impossible.
[O-]C(=O)C[NH3+] glycine-zwitterion
